  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: MortarTeam
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Mortar Team
  role: 2
  description: "Two ISF soldiers with a portable mortar. The Mortar Specialist fires the Mortar Launcher (5 damage, penetration 3, 50 m, once a turn), which can't fire after moving, so set up first and shell targets from long range: penetration 3 cuts through infantry armor and still does half damage to Armor Level 4 tanks. Both soldiers carry Assault Rifles (4 damage, penetration 1, 20 m), and the ISF Rifleman can throw a Frag Grenade as the team's action. With 5 health and Armor Level 2 each, keep them behind your lines. Heavy Support can be taken more than once."
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 505cc634dfb54e1468d719de06910e23, type: 2}
